<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kami Undur Diri — Selamat Tinggal</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html, body {
    min-height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #1a1a2e 0%, #0f0f1a 45%, #05050a 100%);
    color: #cfd6e4;
    font-family: 'Consolas', 'Menlo', 'Courier New', monospace;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    min-height: 100vh;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* bintang halus di latar */
  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 20% 30%, #ffffff55, transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 70%, #ffffff33, transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 20%, #ffffff44, transparent),
      radial-gradient(2px 2px at 35% 85%, #ffffff22, transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 60%, #ffffff55, transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 80%, #ffffff33, transparent);
    background-size: 100% 100%;
    animation: twinkle 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  @keyframes twinkle {
    from { opacity: 0.35; }
    to   { opacity: 0.9; }
  }

  .wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ascii {
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: left;
    color: #7fb4ff;
    font-size: clamp(6px, 1.4vw, 13px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    white-space: pre;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 8px rgba(127, 180, 255, 0.35),
      0 0 24px rgba(127, 180, 255, 0.15);
    animation: fadeIn 2.5s ease forwards;
    opacity: 0;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6));
  }

  .msg {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 17px);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #aab4c8;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    animation: fadeUp 2s ease 1.2s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .msg .title {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    color: #e6edf3;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(127, 180, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .msg p { margin: 6px 0; }

  .msg .sad {
    color: #8aa3c9;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .signature {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.3vw, 13px);
    color: #55627a;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    animation: fadeUp 2s ease 2s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .divider {
    width: 120px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 26px auto 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #7fb4ff55, transparent);
    animation: fadeIn 2s ease 1.8s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ASCII ART: orang melambaikan tangan + hati patah -->
    <div class="ascii">
        .-"""-.
       /       \
      |  o   o  |         .-~~~-.
      |    ^    |        /  .-.  \
      |   '-'   |       |  ( x )  |      _.---._
       \       /         \  '-'  /      /  .-.  \
        '-...-'           '-...-'      |  (   )  |
          | |                            \  '-'  /
      ____|_|____                         '-...-'
     /  goodbye  \
    /   and love  \
   '--------------'
    </div>

    <div class="msg">
      <span class="title">Kami Undur Diri</span>
      <p>Dengan berat hati, kami pamit dari sini.</p>
      <p class="sad">Setiap pertemuan pasti ada perpisahan,</p>
      <p class="sad">dan hari ini adalah giliran kami untuk pergi.</p>
      <p>Terima kasih atas semua kenangan, tawa, dan cerita</p>
      <p>yang tak akan pernah kami lupakan.</p>
      <p class="sad">Maaf jika ada salah kata dan tingkah laku,</p>
      <p class="sad">karena kami bukanlah yang sempurna.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px">Semoga kita dipertemukan kembali,</p>
      <p>di waktu dan tempat yang lebih indah.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="signature">
      — SELAMAT TINGGAL, SAMPAI JUMPA LAGI —
      @burhansyam_
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>